y</strong> from 2025, aligned and matched with the original postcards, lets you see these postcards in a modern context. Plus, learn all about each location with the original 1930s postcard description (<strong>translated for the first time from Japanese</strong>) complemented by present-day updates covering the last 90 years of Japanese history and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784300/extras/06dbafe0622a88ff0aed694bb2dd87db.poster.avif?t=1757698469\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784300/extras/06dbafe0622a88ff0aed694bb2dd87db.webm?t=1757698469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784300/extras/06dbafe0622a88ff0aed694bb2dd87db.mp4?t=1757698469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you find a new treasure, you can head over to the 3D viewer to examine it in <strong>stunning low-poly 3D</strong>, right on your personal computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784300/extras/97667e522e42d5c136405c093346e34b.poster.avif?t=1757698469\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784300/extras/97667e522e42d5c136405c093346e34b.webm?t=1757698469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784300/extras/97667e522e42d5c136405c093346e34b.mp4?t=1757698469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Bolerosoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/